Qwen, I think it would be delightful to invite a group of historical figures from various fields across different eras to share a meal with us. The figures I would choose include:

- Confucius, the ancient Chinese philosopher who taught us the importance of filial piety and kindness;
- Einstein, the scientific genius who revolutionized the scientific world through his theory of relativity;
- Edison, the great inventor who brought light into people's lives, symbolizing the power that can only be achieved and spread through hard work and effort.

Let us all come together at this grand and elegant table filled with delicious food and spirits, sharing in the joy of conversation and camaraderie. It will be an unforgettable experience that leaves a lasting impression on both minds and souls alike.
